            {
                "comment": "It's a bit difficult to recommend Prof Vinayak, 331 gets into complex stats (to understand, not the math). Prof V does mini-lectures at the start of class that don't clear anything up, only take away time from the long exercises. When she comes to answer a question, she doesn't always bring the explanation down to my level (I am a stats dummy).",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 3
